{"title":"开渠歌","alias":"","parts":[{"type":"title","text":"开渠歌"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千年想，万年盼，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"双手劈开天桥断。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山水利化，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旱涝都不怕。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"炮声如雷震河山，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悬空劈山胜鲁班，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愚公能把山来移，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我们决心修成渠，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"炮声响，彩云升，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好象攻打上甘岭。"}],"authors":[],"dates":[{"year":1958}],"is_range_date":false,"comments":[],"comment_pivots":[],"description":"（河南新乡民歌）","page_start":10,"page_end":10}